OL,3,AUS Army to give update after controlled
OL,4,Ablast of degraded explosives in Iowa
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Army is set to give an update
OL,7,Fafter carrying out a controlled blast
OL,8,Fof degraded explosives in Middletown,
OL,9,FIowa - watch live above from 11:00 CST
OL,10,F(17:00 GMT)
OL,12,FSmoke could be seen rising into the sky
OL,13,Fshortly after 09:00 local time -
OL,14,Fofficials say the blast "exceeded all
OL,15,Fexpectations", according to the BBC's
OL,16,FUS partner CBS News
OL,18,FThe controlled detonation of lead azide
OL,19,F- a highly volatile compound - was
OL,20,Fnecessary to prevent an unplanned
OL,21,Fexplosion, the Army says
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
